# Trivy triage file for the DemoApp image — Lab 23.
#
# These nine CRITICAL findings are real and fixable, but every one of them is
# inherited from the application's pinned dependencies, not from the GitOps pipeline:
#   * 8 x tomcat-embed-core 10.1.16   (Spring Boot 3.2.0's managed Tomcat)
#   * 1 x spring-webmvc     6.1.1     (Spring Boot 3.2.0's managed Spring)
# The lab clones DemoApp as-is, so the app is left on 3.2.0 and the findings are
# triaged here instead of silently disappearing. Bumping the Spring Boot parent
# (3.4+) removes them; delete the matching lines when that happens.
#
# Everything not listed here still gates the GitOps pipeline: the Scan stage runs
#   trivy image --severity CRITICAL --ignore-unfixed --exit-code 1
# so a new CRITICAL fails the build.

